# This repository is edited on Windows and deployed to Linux. Anything the voice
# host executes or parses must have LF endings: a CRLF shell script fails at its
# first line with `set: pipefail` (bash reads the \r as part of the option), and
# systemd unit directives break the same way. Force LF regardless of the editing
# platform's defaults.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.path text eol=lf
*.timer text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.env text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
